   "data": {
    "text": "PERSONAL PLOT\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 3, CC 49 to 59\n   1 Own plot weight\n   2 Own plot meets the main plot\n   3 What they want, against what they need\n   4 Secret\n   5 Closer to or further from the goal\n   6 suite: Hidden agenda\n   7 suite: Chasing the wrong thing\n   8 suite: We know, they don't\n   9 pair: When a secret starts slipping, cringe rises\n  10 pair: When the character is set back, their emotional road drops\n  11 pairs: Secrets and lies"
   },
